<title>USA: DataWorks begins public offering.</title>
<headline>DataWorks begins public offering.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>DataWorks Corp said it began its public offering of two million shares of common stock at a price of $21 per share.</p>
<p>DataWorks Corp is a supplier of open systems, client/server-based Enterprise Resource Planning software for mid-sized, discrete manufacturing companies.</p>
